# customer_mgmt.func

> Module: customer_mgmt (Müşteri Yönetimi) | Category: CRM

## Purpose
Customer directory management for logistics companies. Tracks client companies with tax information, warehouse addresses, risk scoring, and transaction history. Central entity that links to invoices, trips, and çek/senet records.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish logistics companies serve hundreds of regular customers
- Tax compliance requires customer tax ID (vergi_no) and tax office (vergi_dairesi) on invoices
- Multiple warehouse/delivery addresses per customer
- Customer risk assessment for credit decisions
- Cross-reference: see all trips, invoices, and payments per customer

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `customers`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| firma_unvani | VARCHAR(200) | Company name |
| vergi_dairesi | VARCHAR(100) | Tax office |
| vergi_no | VARCHAR(20) | Tax ID number |
| telefon | VARCHAR(20) | Phone |
| email | VARCHAR(200) | Email |
| adres | TEXT | Address |
| depo_adresleri | JSONB | Warehouse addresses (array) |
| risk_skoru | INTEGER | Risk score (0-100) |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Related tables:** invoices, trips, cek_senet (all FK to customers.id)

## User Interface
**CustomersPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/customers`
- DataGrid table: Firma Ünvanı, Vergi Dairesi, Vergi No, Telefon, Email
- Search bar with customer name filter
- Add/Edit modal: all customer fields
- Customer detail view: linked trips, invoices, payments
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF
- Bulk operations

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/customers/` | Tenant JWT | List customers (searchable) |
| GET | `/api/tenant/customers/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Customer detail |
| POST | `/api/tenant/customers/` | Tenant JWT | Add customer |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/customers/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit customer |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/customers/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove customer |

## Known Bugs
- None reported

## Test Coverage
- QA test: 3/3 passed (100%)
- Full CRUD verified: Create (302 customers in test data) → List → verify
